cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Glassbox in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Glassbox: telemetry-driven differentiable vehicle dynamics identification"
authors:
  - family-names: Lillibridge
    given-names: Ryland
version: 0.3.0rc1
date-released: 2026-09-08
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rylandl/glassbox"
abstract: >-
  Glassbox learns differentiable rigid-body dynamics from observations and
  commands using one shared-physics formulation with separately fitted weights
  per configuration. It evaluates forecast residuals and supports immutable
  model updates from new recordings.
keywords:
  - system identification
  - differentiable dynamics
  - JAX
  - learned dynamics
  - rigid-body motion
